  "updated_at": "2026-03-29",
  "bio": "Step into the serene ambiance of Europa Tattoo, nestled in the heart of Alicante, Spain, where the art of minimalist designs and expert lettering comes to life on skin. Our professional studio specializes in refined tattoo techniques, including micropigmentation and microblading, ensuring your visit is as unique as your ink. Book your appointment at +34 663 189 396 and join us between 10am to 2pm this August to transform your vision into a timeless masterpiece.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Alicante, Valencian Community, Spain",
